  "[says] Wang Lung expresses his dislike of his sons' cities.",
  "Wang Lung: \"Well, and what good is it for a man to wear a coat with a long tail to it and to walk about with a small round hat on his head, which is only for great lords and rich merchants? And what is this I hear of a new wife of yours?\"",
  "[action] sits and smokes pipe",
